  targetType: 
  description: CryoNodes originated from cryogenic stasis research conducted on deep-space
    vessels. Their purpose was to halt biological processes indefinitely during interstellar
    travel. When containment breaches became common, researchers adapted the technology
    for emergency suppression. What was once meant to preserve life is now used to
    immobilize it.
